{"id":"2021-zhejiang-18","year":2021,"subject":"数学","exam_type":"普通高考","paper":"浙江卷","regions":["浙江"],"question_no":18,"question_type":"solution","stem":"设 $f(x)=\sin x+\cos x$。（1）求 $y=[f(x+\frac\pi2)]^2$ 的最小正周期；（2）求 $y=f(x)f(x-\frac\pi4)$ 在 $[0,\frac\pi2]$ 上的最大值。","options":null,"answer":"（1）$\pi$；（2）$1+\frac{\sqrt2}{2}$","analysis":null,"knowledge_points":["三角函数图象与性质"],"difficulty":"中档","source":{"repository":"deekur/gaokaomath","file":"普通高考/2021/2021浙江.pdf","sha":"6eaa4467044e08aacde2fbcecf7e502748cd4397"}}
