{"id":"2021-zhejiang-20","year":2021,"subject":"数学","exam_type":"普通高考","paper":"浙江卷","regions":["浙江"],"question_no":20,"question_type":"solution","stem":"已知数列 $\{a_n\}$ 前 $n$ 项和为 $S_n$，$a_1=-\frac94$，且 $4S_{n+1}=3S_n-9$。（1）求 $a_n$；（2）设 $3b_n+(n-4)a_n=0$，前 $n$ 项和为 $T_n$，若 $T_n\le\lambda b_n$ 对任意正整数 $n$ 恒成立，求 $\lambda$ 的取值范围。","options":null,"answer":"（1）$a_n=-3(\frac34)^n$；（2）$-3\le\lambda\le1$","analysis":null,"knowledge_points":["数列递推","错位相减"],"difficulty":"中档","source":{"repository":"deekur/gaokaomath","file":"普通高考/2021/2021浙江.pdf","sha":"6eaa4467044e08aacde2fbcecf7e502748cd4397"}}
{"id":"2021-zhejiang-21","year":2021,"subject":"数学","exam_type":"普通高考","paper":"浙江卷","regions":["浙江"],"question_no":21,"question_type":"solution","stem":"如图，$F$ 是抛物线 $y^2=2px(p>0)$ 的焦点，$M$ 是准线与 $x$ 轴交点，且 $|MF|=2$。（1）求抛物线方程；（2）过 $F$ 的直线交抛物线于 $A,B$，斜率为2的直线 $l$ 与 $MA,MB,AB,x$ 轴依次交于 $P,Q,R,N$，且 $|RN|^2=|PN|\cdot|QN|$，求直线 $l$ 在 $x$ 轴上截距的取值范围。","options":null,"answer":"（1）$y^2=4x$；（2）见解析","analysis":null,"knowledge_points":["抛物线","直线与圆锥曲线","最值"],"difficulty":"难题","needs_figure":true,"source":{"repository":"deekur/gaokaomath","file":"普通高考/2021/2021浙江.pdf","sha":"6eaa4467044e08aacde2fbcecf7e502748cd4397"}}
{"id":"2021-zhejiang-22","year":2021,"subject":"数学","exam_type":"普通高考","paper":"浙江卷","regions":["浙江"],"question_no":22,"question_type":"solution","stem":"设 $a,b$ 为实数，$a>1$，$f(x)=a^x-bx+e^2$。（1）求单调区间；（2）若对任意 $b>2e^2$，$f(x)$ 有两个不同零点，求 $a$ 的取值范围；（3）当 $a=e$ 时，证明相应两个零点满足题设不等式。","options":null,"answer":"（1）$b\le0$ 时递增；$b>0$ 时先减后增，分界点 $x=\log_a\frac{b}{\ln a}$；（2）$1<a\le e^2$；（3）证明略","analysis":null,"knowledge_points":["导数","函数零点","参数范围"],"difficulty":"难题","source":{"repository":"deekur/gaokaomath","file":"普通高考/2021/2021浙江.pdf","sha":"6eaa4467044e08aacde2fbcecf7e502748cd4397"}}
